{"words": [{"text": "يَـٰٓأَهْلَ", "translation": "O People"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ", "translation": "(of) the Book"}, {"text": "قَدْ", "translation": "Surely"}, {"text": "جَآءَكُمْ", "translation": "has come to you"}, {"text": "رَسُولُنَا", "translation": "Our Messenger"}, {"text": "يُبَيِّنُ", "translation": "he makes clear"}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "[on]"}, {"text": "فَتْرَةٍۢ", "translation": "(after) an interval (of cessation)"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلرُّسُلِ", "translation": "the Messengers"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "lest"}, {"text": "تَقُولُوا۟", "translation": "you say"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "جَآءَنَا", "translation": "(has) come to us"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "any"}, {"text": "بَشِيرٍۢ", "translation": "bearer of glad tidings"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "نَذِيرٍۢ ۖ", "translation": "a warner"}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "translation": "But surely"}, {"text": "جَآءَكُم", "translation": "has come to you"}, {"text": "بَشِيرٌۭ", "translation": "a bearer of glad tidings"}, {"text": "وَنَذِيرٌۭ ۗ", "translation": "and a warner"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(is) on"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "قَدِيرٌۭ", "translation": "All-Powerful"}], "sahih": "O People of the Scripture, there has come to you Our Messenger to make clear to you [the religion] after a period [of suspension] of messengers, lest you say, \"There came not to us any bringer of good tidings or a warner.\" But there has come to you a bringer of good tidings and a warner. And Allāh is over all things competent."}